fullDescription:
Cats and Mouses is an arcade game about a mouse that has to collect all the cheese in a maze and avoid getting caught by the cats. Steer the mouse, explore the winding corridors, gather the cheese, and dodge the chase — the cats never sleep.

How to play:
- guide the mouse through the maze with swipes;
- collect the cheese on the map;
- collect all the cheese to clear the level;
- if a cat catches the mouse, you lose a life;
- hearts on the map give you an extra life;
- when your lives run out, the level restarts.

Features:
- four cats with different personalities: one chases the mouse, one patrols the corridors, one moves at random, and one lies in ambush;
- 41 levels across eight worlds: grass and bushes, an old castle, an ice cave, a desert canyon, moss and ancient trees, a lost swamp, a volcano, and a giant kitchen;
- a final level for the most persistent;
- pixel art in the spirit of classic arcade games;
- swipe controls on phones and tablets;
- the game works offline.

Who will enjoy it:
Fans of classic arcade games, mazes, and pixel art. The rules are simple: collect the cheese and do not let the cats catch you, while the difficulty grows from level to level.

Collect all the cheese, clear every world, and prove that you can outrun the cats!

